        1   block-level on error undo, throw.
        2   trigger procedure for write of ub.xgroupobj
        3     new buffer new-xgroupobj
        4     old buffer old-xgroupobj
        5   .
        6   if new new-xgroupobj
        7   then
        8      run utl\xattr-f.p (new-xgroupobj.GroupObj-Code, no).
